      "statement": "A thread’s durable sandbox binding is `sandbox_id` in thread metadata, while `SANDBOX_BACKENDS` is a worker-local map of stable per-thread proxies; metadata lookup prefers inline run metadata, falls back to the live thread, and returns no metadata on lookup failure.",
